WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.188
A delayed bus changes the plan. There are small steps you can take.

2
00:00:04.188 --> 00:00:08.813
Check the travel board or app for an update. You can check it again later.

3
00:00:08.813 --> 00:00:13.564
Wait somewhere safe and comfortable if you can. Stay near the stop or staff.

4
00:00:13.564 --> 00:00:17.751
Tell someone you trust that the bus is delayed, if that would help.

5
00:00:17.751 --> 00:00:21.377
Ask staff or another trusted person what your choices are.

6
00:00:21.377 --> 00:00:25.252
Choose whether to wait, take another bus, or change your plan.

7
00:00:25.252 --> 00:00:31.440
You can pause, check the information again, and ask someone to support you.
